{"title":"2017 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/f/a4f2678a17436fc7cc0f2d095b27131b4f2331cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.000315$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" /> is multiplied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/4/f94a61ff8bc9539b9150355da4c8e95c1d59904c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7,928,564$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" /> the product is closest to which of the following?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/4124934f93f7bab91becf4db23d2c419ffbfbd37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }210\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }240\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }2100\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }2400\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }24000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"479\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can approximate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/4/f94a61ff8bc9539b9150355da4c8e95c1d59904c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7,928,564$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a570f88d4777b5e114131ec7cf7e907ef66c4be8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8,000,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/f/a4f2678a17436fc7cc0f2d095b27131b4f2331cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.000315$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/f/59fb4f10470a20d9f73053be7bec6a6134aa1bfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.0003.$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" /> Multiplying the two yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/2636228f8c2831c889cc988fba984733b9017620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2400.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" /> Thus, it shows our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f218da75a878b93f5481f281eb4a908acc89466.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2400}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"86\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~edits by Tarmac-boy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5wa99PngBSo\">https://youtu.be/5wa99PngBSo</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/cY4NYSAD0vQ\">https://youtu.be/cY4NYSAD0vQ</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/wau6o6XP8hY\">https://youtu.be/wau6o6XP8hY</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8\" title=\"2017 AMC 8\">2017 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Probl